{"unit_id":"lihuu__dsh-lazy-skill#card-zh","repo":"lihuu/dsh-lazy-skill","commit":"40d3ada4cab9882012ff5292d92e42dd96dc327d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-bundle 是一个 DSH 技能扩展，适合把一组相关技能组织成盒子，并按需加载到会话中。它向技能提供器注册每个盒子的根技能，同时把子技能留在模型目录之外；用户或模型可通过浏览工具查看子技能名称，再按名称加载需要的内容。根技能还可用 loadSubskills 元数据选择加载全部子技能、指定子集，或沿用根技能正文。插件也支持自定义盒子目录，并为每个子技能保留各自的资源目录。适合维护工具链、分阶段流程或项目任务组的 DSH 用户；需要安装 DeepSeek Harness 和受支持版本的 Node.js，不要求额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:130-169","src/index.ts:184-213","src/index.ts:215-343","src/index.ts:51-71"]}
{"unit_id":"lihuu__dsh-lazy-skill#card-en","repo":"lihuu/dsh-lazy-skill","commit":"40d3ada4cab9882012ff5292d92e42dd96dc327d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-skill-bundle groups DSH skills into boxes for on-demand loading. Root skills stay in the model catalog; tools browse child names and load bodies. Root metadata can expand all or named children. It suits multi-step workflows and needs DeepSeek Harness and supported Node.js, with no extra API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:130-169","src/index.ts:184-213","src/index.ts:215-343","src/index.ts:51-71"]}
